---
title: "cancel (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: authorized
    q_check_published --> q_cancel: results not yet published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_published: results already published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert CannotCancelAfterResults
    q_cancel --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled

    note right of q_cancel
        INV-001: cancel only allowed before results publication
        INV-002: only projectAdmin can cancel
        INV-003: after cancellation, investors can withdraw via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled
    end note
